### 📄 `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.env
.env

# Jupyter Notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints

# Reports & Logs
test_report.json
*.log

# Selenium & ChromeDriver temp files
*.crdownload
*.tmp
.chromedriver/
chromedriver.exe

# VSCode
.vscode/

# OS-specific
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
